\p{This definition and what follows in \Mathlib is initially presented in \citek{wieser2022formalizing},
  some further developments are based on \citek{grinberg2016clifford}, and in turn based on \citek{bourbaki2007algebra}
  which is in French and never translated to English.}

\p{The most informative English reference on \citek{bourbaki2007algebra} is \linebreak \citek{jadczyk2019notes}, 
  which has an updated exposition in \citek{jadczyk2023bundle}.}